    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in SEEING RED, a single-player, first-person survival horror experience that pulls you into a chilling narrative filled with suspense and mystery. You step into the shoes of Benjamin, an ex-military private detective whose troubled past comes back to haunt him when he returns to his forgotten childhood town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEEING RED</strong> is a full-featured first-person survival horror game that offers an intense and immersive experience. This product includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Story Campaign</strong> \u2013 A gripping, atmospheric narrative following your search for your missing sister, uncovering dark secrets along the way. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Combat</strong> \u2013 Use firearms and melee weapons to fight off relentless monsters, but beware\u2014ammo and stamina are limited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Evasion</strong> \u2013 Hide, run, or find alternative ways to survive against creatures hunting you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Search for clues, interact with NPCs, and uncover the town\u2019s dark secrets through dialogue and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-Making</strong> \u2013 Your choices affect how the story unfolds, leading to different outcomes and interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles &amp; Lore Discovery</strong> \u2013 Solve cryptic puzzles, piece together hidden lore, and unveil the truth behind the horrors that surround you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Experience</strong> \u2013 Photorealistic visuals, dynamic sound design, and psychological horror elements that heighten tension and fear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127240/extras/2c810157469890726a4b2af0ce29568d.poster.avif?t=1754597609\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127240/extras/2c810157469890726a4b2af0ce29568d.webm?t=1754597609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127240/extras/2c810157469890726a4b2af0ce29568d.mp4?t=1754597609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127240/extras/f7045ef0f432cf045e0cb9aea41c0a5e.poster.avif?t=1754597609\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127240/extras/f7045ef0f432cf045e0cb9aea41c0a5e.webm?t=1754597609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127240/extras/f7045ef0f432cf045e0cb9aea41c0a5e.mp4?t=1754597609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127240/extras/a6837fee8d5401dd61555be7df7b88c5.poster.avif?t=1754597609\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127240/extras/a6837fee8d5401dd61555be7df7b88c5.webm?t=1754597609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127240/extras/a68